--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party components referenced by this project (not redistributed here):

  Syphon              https://syphon.github.io/
                      frame sharing with OBS; the built framework is expected
                      in ASFireWire/Vendor/Syphon.framework and is not part of
                      the patch set.

  BlackHole           https://existential.audio/blackhole/
                      virtual audio device (GPL-3.0), installed separately.

  OBS Studio /        https://github.com/obsproject/obs-websocket/
  obs-websocket       used by the launcher to configure the scene (GPL-2.0).

  FFmpeg              https://ffmpeg.org/
                      reference decoder used to verify audio and frame
                      geometry, and to generate test DV streams.
